fixture kindle_from_cling_goes_away
doc Movement review 6, M3, the control for kindle_on_cling_frame_goes_away: Kindle cast forward a tick after the cling (stick still toward the wall) goes away from the wall.
room test/shaft
option flame 33
spawn 690 100
frames 50
